OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-migrant activist charged
OL,4,Aafter dinghy slashed in Channel
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-migrant activist Daniel Thomas has
OL,7,Fbeen charged after he was seen in a
OL,8,Fvideo slashing at a dinghy in the
OL,9,FEnglish Channel with a knife.
OL,11,FThe 37-year-old, known to his
OL,12,Fsupporters as Danny Tommo, has been
OL,13,Fcharged with criminal damage and
OL,14,Ffailing to disclose the PIN to his
OL,15,Fphone, Hampshire Police said.
OL,17,FHe has been remanded in custody to
OL,18,Fappear at Basingstoke Magistrates'
OL,19,FCourt on Friday morning.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
