OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-migrant activist charged
OL,4,Aafter dinghy slashed in Channel
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral hundred people, many wearing
OL,7,Fblack, had gathered outside a police
OL,8,Finvestigation centre in Basingstoke on
OL,9,FThursday evening believing Thomas was
OL,10,Finside.
